deflection from
'"\\cref{thm:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_B_2:signed_deflection_eq_formula}
makes the remaining branch strict.)
\\end{proof}

\\subsection*{Official answer (conclusion side only)}

\\begin{definition}[Rounding band for the official signed value]
\\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_B_2:roundsToOfficialDegrees}
\\lean{IPhO2026.Problem1.B2.roundsToOfficialDegrees}
The predicate on a real "'$x$ asserting that $x$ rounds to the official
